- [MEN GRUNTING]

390
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,200
- [BLOW LANDS]
- [MAN GRUNTS]

391
00:19:39,833 --> 00:19:40,933
[SLINGSHOT SNAPS]

392
00:19:41,567 --> 00:19:43,133
[OVERLAPPING CLAMOR]

393
00:19:43,133 --> 00:19:44,267
Hurry!

394
00:19:44,633 --> 00:19:46,200
- Hurry!
- They're catching up!

395
00:19:46,567 --> 00:19:47,700
- Go hide!
- Hurry up!

396
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:50,233
- [RAPID GUNFIRE]
- [DABOY] They got us!

397
00:19:50,533 --> 00:19:51,667
Hurry up!

398
00:19:51,667 --> 00:19:58,400
[RAPID GUNFIRE]

399
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,833
Tell the others.

400
00:19:59,833 --> 00:20:01,800
Let's trap them in the alley!

401
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:06,667
[RAPID GUNFIRE]

402
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:08,267
- Let's go! Let's go!
- Run!

403
00:20:08,267 --> 00:20:13,800
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

404
00:20:14,533 --> 00:20:16,600
What kind of mess has Gabo
gotten himself into this time?

405
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,400
Those guys he's been
fighting are attacking again.

406
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,467
[DANTE] Don't worry!

407
00:20:19,467 --> 00:20:20,867
Gabo can handle it!

408
00:20:20,933 --> 00:20:23,100
There's no mess
he can't get out of!

409
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:24,567
There's only two things
that can happen!

410
00:20:24,567 --> 00:20:26,467
He'll either get hurt
or hurt someone!

411
00:20:26,467 --> 00:20:27,900
- Let's go!
- Where?

412
00:20:27,900 --> 00:20:29,100
Where to?

413
00:20:30,133 --> 00:20:31,767
[SLINGSHOT SNAPS]

414
00:20:32,633 --> 00:20:33,700
[BLOW LANDS]

415
00:20:34,033 --> 00:20:36,133
[SLINGSHOT SNAPS]

416
00:20:36,167 --> 00:20:38,700
[OVERLAPPING CLAMOR]

417
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:40,500
- Let's go!
- Wait!

418
00:20:40,500 --> 00:20:43,900
[GUNSHOTS]

419
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:44,967
Let's go!

420
00:20:44,967 --> 00:20:51,467
[RAPID GUNFIRE]

421
00:20:51,467 --> 00:20:52,533
Let's go!

422
00:20:52,833 --> 00:20:58,867
[RAPID GUNFIRE]

423
00:20:58,867 --> 00:21:00,000
Let's go!

424
00:21:01,067 --> 00:21:02,200
Let's go!

425
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:04,167
Come on, let's surround them!

426
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,233
This way!

427
00:21:06,233 --> 00:21:08,900
[RAPID GUNFIRE]

428
00:21:08,933 --> 00:21:13,067
