429
00:21:13,067 --> 00:21:14,367
- [MEN YELLING]
- [KNIVES SWING]

430
00:21:15,067 --> 00:21:17,067
[GABO GRUNTING]

431
00:21:17,067 --> 00:21:18,167
[GUNSHOTS]

432
00:21:19,900 --> 00:21:21,767
- [RAPID GUNFIRE]
- [BLOW LANDS]

433
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:25,733
[BLOWS LANDING]

434
00:21:26,667 --> 00:21:28,033
[GABO GRUNTING]

435
00:21:28,033 --> 00:21:31,233
[BLOWS LANDING]

436
00:21:32,533 --> 00:21:33,967
[OVERLAPPING CLAMOR]

437
00:21:33,967 --> 00:21:35,067
[TEKLA SCREAMING]

438
00:21:35,500 --> 00:21:36,700
[GUNS CLICK]

439
00:21:37,933 --> 00:21:39,833
- I'm out of ammo!
- Me too!

440
00:21:39,833 --> 00:21:41,200
What do we do?

441
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,533
Tekla, we're here!

442
00:21:42,567 --> 00:21:43,867
Alright, keep watch over there!

443
00:21:43,867 --> 00:21:45,433
- Move!
- Hurry!

444
00:21:45,433 --> 00:21:46,600
[DABOY] Hurry!

445
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:49,700
[GUNSHOTS]

446
00:21:49,700 --> 00:21:52,067
Daboy, where's the backup?
Why aren't they here yet?

447
00:21:52,067 --> 00:21:53,467
They're already taking
their positions!

448
00:21:53,467 --> 00:21:54,900
- [GUNSHOTS]
- Let's wait for them!

449
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:56,900
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

450
00:21:58,133 --> 00:21:59,533
- Drop your guns!
- Drop your guns!

451
00:21:59,533 --> 00:22:01,467
- Drop your guns!
- Drop your guns!

452
00:22:01,533 --> 00:22:02,667
What?

453
00:22:02,667 --> 00:22:04,333
- Where are you going?
- Get down!

454
00:22:04,333 --> 00:22:10,567
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

455
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:12,633
What?

456
00:22:12,633 --> 00:22:13,733
Get down!

457
00:22:13,733 --> 00:22:16,133
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

458
00:22:16,167 --> 00:22:20,900
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [MEN GRUNTING]

459
00:22:21,900 --> 00:22:23,333
[MAN YELLING]

460
00:22:23,333 --> 00:22:27,667
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [MEN GRUNTING]

461
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:29,133
Hey!

462
00:22:29,133 --> 00:22:30,667
Eat this!

463
00:22:30,667 --> 00:22:32,300
[BLOWS LANDING]

464
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:33,500
- Ahh!
- There!

465
00:22:35,767 --> 00:22:42,600
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [MEN GRUNTING]

466
00:22:46,233 --> 00:22:47,333
[SLINGSHOT FIRES]

467
00:22:47,633 --> 00:22:49,500
Backup's here!

468
00:22:49,533 --> 00:22:50,600
They're here!

469
00:22:51,433 --> 00:22:52,567
Take them down!

470
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:54,700
[MAN] Keep going! Keep going!

471
00:22:55,267 --> 00:22:56,367
[BLOW LANDS]

472
00:23:00,367 --> 00:23:01,500
[BLOW LANDS]

473
00:23:03,833 --> 00:23:04,867
[BLOW LANDS]

474
00:23:07,133 --> 00:23:08,267
[GABO GRUNTING]

475
00:23:08,267 --> 00:23:09,300
[KNIVES SLASHING]

476
00:23:10,500 --> 00:23:11,533
[BLOW LANDS]

477
00:23:12,333 --> 00:23:19,100
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [MEN GRUNTING]

478
00:23:19,733 --> 00:23:20,800
