479
00:23:20,800 --> 00:23:22,700
- [BLOWS LANDING]
- [MEN GRUNTING]

480
00:23:22,733 --> 00:23:23,800
Let's go!

481
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:28,767
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

482
00:23:29,467 --> 00:23:31,733
[GABO GRUNTING]

483
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:40,867
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

484
00:23:45,533 --> 00:23:46,900
[MAN] Stop!

485
00:23:46,900 --> 00:23:48,867
We won't fight anymore!

486
00:23:48,867 --> 00:23:50,200
Ahh! Enough!

487
00:23:52,133 --> 00:23:53,500
[SAM] Gabo!

488
00:23:53,500 --> 00:23:54,933
Gabo, don't!

489
00:23:54,933 --> 00:23:56,133
[MAMENG] Gabo!

490
00:23:56,167 --> 00:24:03,000
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

491
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,067
Don't...

492
00:24:13,533 --> 00:24:15,567
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

493
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:18,967
[RUDY] Son...

494
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:20,767
No.

495
00:24:21,133 --> 00:24:23,000
Don't take the law
into your own hands.

496
00:24:23,733 --> 00:24:26,900
Gabo, you promised me
you'd never go back to prison!

497
00:24:26,900 --> 00:24:29,767
Don't waste your life, dear!

498
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:30,900
[DANTE] Gabo!

499
00:24:30,900 --> 00:24:32,300
Listen to Gloria!

500
00:24:32,967 --> 00:24:34,100
You promised, didn't you?

501
00:24:34,633 --> 00:24:36,167
That we'd start our own family.

502
00:24:36,500 --> 00:24:37,467
If you pull the trigger,

503
00:24:37,467 --> 00:24:39,200
all of our dreams
will melt away.

504
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:46,133
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

505
00:24:46,833 --> 00:24:49,600
[BREATHING DEEPLY]

506
00:25:00,567 --> 00:25:07,467
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

507
00:25:11,267 --> 00:25:12,767
I'm sorry.

508
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,667
I really am.

509
00:25:23,133 --> 00:25:24,300
[MAN] Gabo...

510
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,800
Thank you.

511
00:25:26,800 --> 00:25:28,567
You saved our lives again.

512
00:25:28,567 --> 00:25:31,233
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

513
00:25:31,233 --> 00:25:32,533
[FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING]

514
00:25:32,533 --> 00:25:33,633
[TEKLA] Gabo!

515
00:25:33,633 --> 00:25:35,333
It's over.
We took the enemies out.

516
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:36,867
Gabo, let's go now!

517
00:25:36,867 --> 00:25:38,933
They might come back!

518
00:25:39,433 --> 00:25:41,233
- [MAMENG] Gabo, come on!
- [RUDY] Let's go!

519
00:25:41,233 --> 00:25:43,067
- We should go, Gabo!
- Gabo...

520
00:25:43,967 --> 00:25:44,967
Come with us.

521
00:25:45,333 --> 00:25:46,433
[SIGHS]

522
00:25:46,433 --> 00:25:53,367
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

523
00:25:53,367 --> 00:25:54,700
Long live Gabo!

524
00:25:54,700 --> 00:25:55,900
- Long live!
- Long live!

525
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:57,300
[CHANTING] Gabo!

526
00:25:57,300 --> 00:26:03,600
[ALL]
Gabo! Gabo! Gabo! Gabo!

527
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:06,667
Gabo! Gabo!

528
00:26:06,667 --> 00:26:11,167
Gabo! Gabo! Gabo!

529
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:16,867
Gabo! Gabo! Gabo! Gabo!

530
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:19,367
<i>Tonight, we're gathered
to remember the life</i>

531
00:26:19,367 --> 00:26:20,633
<i> of Samantha Jacinto.</i>

532
00:26:20,633 --> 00:26:23,533
<i>If you want to kill them,
I won't stop you.</i>

533
00:26:23,533 --> 00:26:26,767
<i>I guess this is the struggle
of the rich:</i>

534
00:26:26,767 --> 00:26:29,733
<i>deciding how
to spend their money.</i>

535
00:26:29,733 --> 00:26:30,867
<i> Listen, Gloria.</i>

536
00:26:30,867 --> 00:26:33,000
<i>I'm willing to give my life
for you.</i>

537
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:34,167
<i> Even if I have to die,</i>

538
00:26:34,167 --> 00:26:37,333
<i>I'll always be here, ready
to love and protect you.</i>

539
00:26:37,333 --> 00:26:38,333
<i> That's how much I love you.</i>

540
00:26:38,333 --> 00:26:39,800
<i> You might be forgetting.</i>

541
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:41,200
<i> She's an NCIA agent.</i>

542
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:43,667
<i>What if she knocks her head
and it all comes back to her?</i>

543
00:26:43,700 --> 00:26:45,967
<i>- Oh, wow!
- Looking sharp!</i>

544
00:26:45,967 --> 00:26:47,367
<i> You're so handsome, Gabo!</i>

545
00:26:47,367 --> 00:26:48,367
<i> Take care.</i>

546
00:26:48,367 --> 00:26:50,200
<i>- No goodbye kiss?
- Just one!</i>

547
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,300
<i> Just on the cheek.</i>

548
00:26:52,033 --> 00:26:54,700
[CHEERING]

549
00:26:54,700 --> 00:26:55,733
<i> Bye!</i>

550
00:26:55,733 --> 00:26:59,300
<i>Each mission rewards you
with a lot of money.</i>

551
00:26:59,300 --> 00:27:02,667
<i>But it comes at the cost
of a great sacrifice.</i>

552
00:27:02,667 --> 00:27:04,133
<i> Somebody needs to act.</i>

553
00:27:04,133 --> 00:27:05,567
<i> Somebody needs to lead.</i>

554
00:27:05,567 --> 00:27:06,600
<i> And that will be me.</i>

555
00:27:06,600 --> 00:27:08,767
You are the blade of the spear.

556
00:27:08,767 --> 00:27:10,667
<i> The edge of the sword.</i>

557
00:27:10,667 --> 00:27:13,667
<i> You are the fist of Anino.</i>
